      "id": "file:services/playlist_service.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "playlist_service.py",
      "filePath": "services/playlist_service.py",
      "summary": "Service layer handling playlist creation and retrieval, including fetching a playlist's ordered songs and a user's owned playlists.",
      "tags": ["service", "playlist", "business-logic"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "get_playlist_songs slices the query result with songs[:-1] before returning, which drops the last song even though the docstring says it returns all songs in playlist order — a likely off-by-one bug worth investigating as part of the project's bug hunt."
    },
